    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm writing a lit review for my econ class about the 1980s. i'm a bit stuck on how to frame the outcome of all those deregulation policies. what's the general consensus among economists on whether those moves actually worked to drive growth or if they just messed up wealth equality?",
